{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Aerith","id":"260949833773219840","is_bot":0,"username":"aerith_of_aer"},"author_id":"260949833773219840","channel_id":"736456059014742088","content":"Cato shakes his head. \"No. This wound is meant to be here. I have not earned healing. It is my fault Rah died.\" His voice is shaky so different to the normally calm demeanor. \"I was busy dancing the night away. While someone needed help. I failed\" He is trying to hold back tears but all the emotions from the past few days are catching up to him","created_at":"2020-07-27T00:21:17.213000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"737102275650125894","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"nut_wizard","id":"594008151779573762","is_bot":0,"username":"nut_wizard"},"author_id":"594008151779573762","channel_id":"736456059014742088","content":"“—have not earned—“\nHe copies the sound of a knife cutting flesh. He pushes the stars closer to Cato.","created_at":"2020-07-27T00:23:11.244000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"737102753930805359","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
