{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"nut_wizard","id":"594008151779573762","is_bot":0,"username":"nut_wizard"},"author_id":"594008151779573762","channel_id":"736456059014742088","content":"♪  sighs and puts them back, acquiescing. He does point somewhat sternly to Cato and copy,\n“I failed.”\nWith a disapproving shake of his head.","created_at":"2020-07-27T00:27:04.676000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"737103733015445576","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Aerith","id":"260949833773219840","is_bot":0,"username":"aerith_of_aer"},"author_id":"260949833773219840","channel_id":"736456059014742088","content":"\"I am the scout. I have to see what is going on and warn others before the danger can arrive. I spent the night not doing my duty. The alarms went off the first time and I slept. The second time I was... preacupied. And now Rah has died. I did not scout, I got comfortable in these last 2 months. I cannot afford to make the same mistake on the island.\"","created_at":"2020-07-27T00:30:24.801000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"737104572400795660","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
